    "html": "<p>The diagram shows a simple model of the four energy levels in an atom.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the best estimate for the smallest and for the largest frequency in the absorption spectrum of the atom?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Smallest frequency in absorption spectrum</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Largest frequency in absorption spectrum</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> PHz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> PHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> PHz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\"></span> PHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\"></span> PHz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> PHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\"></span> PHz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\"></span> PHz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
